OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 10 DEC
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GKazuki Yamada conducts the City
OL,6,     Gof Birmingham Symphony Orchestra
OL,7,     Gin an all-Strauss programme,
OL,8,     Gincluding Also Sprach
OL,9,     GZarathustra, a piece with one of
OL,10,     Gmusic's most iconic openings.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland in Song
OL,12,     GMusic knows many different forms
OL,13,     Gin Scotland, as a result of her
OL,14,     Gradically different traditions.
OL,15,     GPoet Kenneth Steven chooses to
OL,16,     Gexplore the stories of five
OL,17,     Gcomposers.
