OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 10 DEC
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GTonight, anaiis spotlights for
OL,12,     GFlowers a saxophonist and
OL,13,     Gbandleader who is widely
OL,14,     Gcelebrated for her creative
OL,15,     Gcompositions and distinctive
OL,16,     Gsound.
OL,17,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,18,     GRachel Podger plays violin
OL,19,     Gsonatas by Biber and Froberger
OL,20,     Gwith lutenist Elizabeth Kenny and
OL,21,     GMarcin Swiatkiewicz at the
OL,22,     Gharpsichord. Penny Gore presents.
